# microsoft-defender-shieldbreak-zero-day-grants-system-privileges — KQL variant (derived from microsoft-defender-shieldbreak-zero-day-grants-system-privileges.sigma via sigma convert)
ParentImage endswith "\\wer.dll" and (Image endswith "\\conhost.exe" and IntegrityLevel =~ "System")

(Image endswith "\\schtasks.exe" and CommandLine contains "QueueReporting") or ((Image endswith "\\powershell.exe" or Image endswith "\\pwsh.exe") and (CommandLine contains "Register-ScheduledTask" and CommandLine contains "QueueReporting"))
